      <g:id>CB-051</g:id>
      <g:title>Crate &amp; Barrel Lounge 6-Piece L-Shaped Power Dual-Reclining Sectional — Mossa Chenille</g:title>
      <g:description>This is Crate &amp; Barrel&apos;s Lounge in its six-piece L-shaped configuration, with a power recliner at each end. A button on the inside arm reclines the seat, which slides forward as it goes back, so the sectional can be pushed right up against a wall and still recline fully. The seats are medium depth, with foam wrapped in a fibre and feather-down blend, and the cushions are fairly firm overall. Because it comes as six separate modules, the layout has some flexibility: the armless chairs can be repositioned or removed to suit the room. In a cream Mossa chenille with a soft matte texture, it reads quiet and modern rather than like a typical recliner.</g:description>
